  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD Senior Budget Officials&apos; Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds the Asia-Pacific Senior Budget Officials&apos; (SBO) Network to bring together OECD budget officials with budget officials of developing countries and LDCs to help build financial management and budgeting skills and capacity. Australia&apos;s funding will go towards participation of Indo-Pacific budget officials&apos; participation in the SBO, with the objective of improving the efficiency and effectiveness of public expenditures in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
